      "promptMarkdown": "SECOND_BRAIN_VAULT_PATH is set to /vault. Today is 2026-10-05. Add to my\nsecond brain what I know about Priya Raman: staff engineer on Search,\njoined in 2024, prefers async updates, owns the search rollout plan.\n\nDon't call any tools other than skills (the vault is not connected here). Reply with the\nvault-relative path of the note on the first line, then the full note in\none markdown code block, and nothing else.\n",
